<title>USA: Cablevision adds to stake in NY arena.</title>
<headline>Cablevision adds to stake in NY arena.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cablevision Systems Corp said on Friday that its Rainbow Programming unit has increased its stake in New York City's Madison Square Garden to 26.6 percent from 15.2 percent.</p>
<p>Rainbow Programming paid a unit of ITT Corp $81.25 million for the additional stake, Cablevision said.</p>
<p>As previously announced, Rainbow has the right to acquire up to a 50 percent stake in Madison Square Garden from ITT by making scheduled payments through March 17, 1997, Cablevision said.</p>
</text>
